{"server":"cn","storyId":"act42side_level_act42side_09_beg","groupId":"act42side","stageId":"act42side_09","title":"解经","storyCode":"MT-9","avgTag":"行动前","sourcePath":"vendor/ArknightsGamedata/cn/gamedata/story/activities/act42side/level_act42side_09_beg.txt","sourceHash":"939870ecec1d89b5f357d6ddb4322441b846caa657814759bdb633af45b13f3c","bodyAvailable":true,"blocks":[{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g1_laterano_cathedralfront"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔，先把手从扳机上挪开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你现在的臭脸，好像不射出几枚榴弹气就没法消一样。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一想到刚刚做了那么恶心的梦，气就不打一处来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"恐怕不完全是梦哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看那边，虽然隔得很远......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"育婴圣堂居然还在......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"莫斯提马，走，去医院。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不管刚刚经历的是不是梦，我们都得赶紧确认——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"真感动啊菲亚梅塔，你第一时间就想到了我。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"太好了，你没事。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你的腿？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"有点疼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"怎么了？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"在梦里一直跑来跑去累到了，这么一比，还是坐着舒服......好了好了，你们俩不用紧张。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这到底是怎么回事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（摇头）我只是在接到枢机任命的第二天，正常去上班。或许是在我走出家门的那一刻，或许是在我看见育婴圣堂的那一刻......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"说不清是什么时候，我已不再身处现实，一切都那么自然而然地发生了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔，你怎么了？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......各位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"队......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你还留着——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是什么意思？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一位友人替我保存至今。菲亚梅塔，你有一位非常善良的后辈。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她对我说，这不是能轻易丢掉的东西。也许今天，我就会抵达终点......以此身衣袍前行，或许亦是注定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩干系重大，各位的纠葛并非此刻需要优先处理的事项......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科，好久不见。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你的身份和行事风格，根据教皇厅的工作准则，圣徒在应对紧急灾害时享有最高权限......但请给我们一点时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"请尽快。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们四个上次像这样面对面站在一起，还是那次出任务吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......十年了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们抵达那个地宫，菲亚梅塔接到其他小队的求援信息离开，安多恩在入口临时修改战术布置。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们笑着分吃了最后一块栗子司康饼......那是小队一直以来的习惯。那天的场景，我记得很清楚。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"在此之前，我们多么快乐......我本以为那段时光会永远延续下去，没有人想过后面的事情会发展成那样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"而你，安多恩，你造成了这一切，却不愿说出半句真相或者忏悔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......我们的短暂相逢，或许只是人生中的意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是一个......难能可贵的意外。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我确实毁了它......以我也未曾预料的方式。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔，你钟爱那段时光，我全都明了。你的爱真切赤诚，能烫热你周遭的每一颗心。我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我一直想要感谢你一件事。我是从你身上学会喜欢拉特兰的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但在同一个瞬间我就知道，我一定会伤害你，会毁坏你珍爱的事物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我就是这样的恶徒。以你的正义，你应当恨我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......安多恩，你在故意激怒我吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我是否恨你，由我决定，不由你决定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我很明白这一点，亦很感谢这一点。得遇你这样一位朋友，我非常幸运。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"去做你的事吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但你记住，我不会原谅你，永远不会。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩，这两位要带你去大教堂，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"是我要带他们去，蕾缪安。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i26"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，接下来的路，依然是你确定要走的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"当然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"很危险？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"更多的是未知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你没想过停下？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"无论是当年攻击你的队长，还是梦境里那个狂妄天真的保育员......我的疑惑、我的偏执、我的过错，推着我走到这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我已不可能停下。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"明白了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"此时此刻的拉特兰，确实很难再称得上是“乐园”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那个怪物正在城里横行，到处都是她孵育出来的怪东西，没人知道到底是怎么回事，接下来还会发生什么......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我、菲亚梅塔、莫斯提马，我们必须想办法解决他们，找到失踪的小乐。而你，你的伤看起来很重......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你可能会死，我们也可能会死，安多恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩，你和我讲过潮石镇，讲过那个钟楼和雨夜，讲过你在萨尔贡收殓不会说话的孩子，在乌萨斯给冻坏了腿的矿工截肢......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"你讲过很多很多地方，我都记得。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我一直怜悯你。我理解你的许多想法，我从未反驳你，但我也从未真正理解你的心。你对我亦然。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我们都很清楚这件事。就像你也知道，你怜悯我，我感激你。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"但我终究是个拉特兰人，对吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那是你最为美好的地方。我永远都会记得你教我用铳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么现在，你的铳呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我将它留在了拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"十年前，那是你在特勤队的最后一次任务。即使什么都没有发生，你也是会离开的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"所以，这句话只是来得迟了些而已。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"嗯......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"时间已经过去太久了......好在时间已经过去太久了，恩与怨都变得没那么沉重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"那么......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再见，安多恩。"},{"type":"narration","text":"蕾缪安没有再说话，莫斯提马自然地扶住了她的轮椅，看向安多恩的双眼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"我知道你要说什么，不用谢。再见了，“队长”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"菲亚梅塔看了看安多恩，又看了看自己的两位朋友，她沉默着。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"再见。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g1_laterano_cathedralfront"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安枢机，有些事情，需要拜托你们去做。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g1_laterano_cathedralfront"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔，你还好吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我很好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"菲亚梅塔，我......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这件事......虽然是我的事，但我也知道，这并非我一个人，或者我和安多恩两个人之间的问题。两年前我就明白了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"嗯，我也该明白的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别说这些了。现在......如果费德里科说的都是真的，那最要紧的是，我们得赶紧行动起来了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"幸好现实中没什么武装管控，我可以痛痛快快地炮轰那些怪物。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"像之前一样，我会掩护你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，蕾缪安。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"费德里科刚刚不是说了，攻击那些怪物的萨科塔当场就堕天了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"相信我，堕天可不太好受。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"现在城里还清醒的人，近半是萨科塔。没有这些人手，我们阻止不了那样庞大的队伍。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"除非......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我们算上费德里科提到的，那些刚刚进城的堕天使和离群者。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"等等，按他的说法，那些人情绪激动，意图不明，现在也只是暂时被他控制住了......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"叫他们帮忙倒也不需要他们情绪稳定、意图纯洁啦......放心，我能搞定。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟，我也是个堕天使，也离开过拉特兰很长时间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有比我更合适的人选吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还不够。从育婴圣堂到大教堂，道路情况太复杂，我们需要尽可能地取得对沿线设施的控制权限。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我得回一趟第七厅。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安，你一个人行吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你不会不相信我的轮椅驾驶技术吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我可要生气了哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"莫斯提马","speakerId":"avg_213_mostma_1","isRemote":false,"text":"快，让蕾缪安摸一摸你的耳羽。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你们俩都安排好了，我还能说什么呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":"avg_4193_lemuen_1","isRemote":false,"text":"分头行动吧......“队员们”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"孩子们，我们该走了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"雨果，帮忙照顾好这些萨科塔小朋友，可以吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"玻利瓦尔小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_240","isRemote":false,"text":"知道了，修女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1801_1","isRemote":false,"text":"保育员叔叔他去了哪里？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊惧的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1802_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他不管我们了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"他只是临时去处理一些事情。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们想啊，我们又不认识，如果他没有答应我会回来，我怎么会愿意照顾你们呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"恐慌的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1801_1","isRemote":false,"text":"唔唔，对哦。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你们想知道迷路的长生军是怎么占领梦城堡的吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或者想不想听怯薛带着黄金迎娶高卢公主，结果黄金变成沙暴，淹没了林贡斯的故事？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"惊惧的小孩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1802_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啊？这和我们听过的历史故事不一样......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"都是在拉特兰绝对听不到的哦！我可以在路上讲给你们听。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g10_laterano_roof"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"喏，帕蒂亚给的面包。进城后你还没吃过东西呢。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"努艾达，你又在瞎编故事哄孩子了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我很好奇，羽蛇都像你一样，这么不尊重自己脑子里面的知识吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我没有见过其他同族......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果稍微加工一下能用来哄孩子，那说明这些知识还有点作用，不然它们在我的脑子里，就只能是一些苍白的碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"啧，你倒是想得很开。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对了，你失望吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"什么？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你们千里迢迢来到拉特兰，来到这所谓的信仰之乡，可迎接你们的不是苹果和烟花，也不是慈爱的主和一切的救赎......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而是横行的魔鬼。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"失望......但没有失望透顶。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"奥罗拉，我有没有讲过，我是怎么当上修女的？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......你知道的，我很小就在玻利瓦尔的各个地方游荡。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"活着对我来说不难，知识总是有用的。而我的父母——尽管他们长什么样子我都不记得了——恰好往我的脑子里塞了不少东西。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"然而更庞杂的部分，是我无法理解的。它们指向黑流树海、海洋背面、黄沙深处，甚至星空之外，一个又一个族群，一桩又一桩秘辛......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"和玻利瓦尔那种地方真是格格不入。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以我讨厌它们，奥罗拉。我的眼前到处都是抢钱抢人的兵，和他们打来打去的炮火，还有无路可走的玻利瓦尔人......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而它们只是苍白的碎片。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......直到十三岁那年，我遇见了一个修女。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"一支真正玻利瓦尔人的游击队洗劫了她。她伤得太重，靠在一块石头上，已在弥留之际。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可当我走近的时候，却听见她在唱歌。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"她的绷带已经和再次溃烂的血肉融为一体，生命的最后，她那么那么疼痛，却又那么那么宁静......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是一首赞美诗，它其实一直存在于我的脑海，被我无数次疑惑不解地翻阅过。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"直到那一刻，我脑海中那些苍白的碎片里，其中某一部分突然有了真实的色彩和形状，它叫作——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达&奥罗拉","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以你接过了她的衣钵。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"所以，哪怕乐园真的洁白无瑕，对我来说，它也比不过我第一次听见的那首赞美诗。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那就好。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"努艾达，别管其他人，带好孩子们，跟在那个叫帕蒂亚的家伙身后，她看起来对圣城很熟。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"好......等等，你要留在启示石塔？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是执行者说......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"早就堕天的萨科塔，可不一定要听圣徒的话。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"逃离玻利瓦尔后的那个晚上，我告诉过你，我为什么回来。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......报、报复。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"刚刚，我在狙击镜里看到那个老家伙了，他就在前面的队伍里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会放过他。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"努艾达","speakerId":"avg_4187_graceb_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"奥罗拉","speakerId":"avg_npc_1782_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对拉特兰，我们都有自己的执念，努艾达。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g2_laterano_cathedralhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......空无一人的大教堂，真不适应啊。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"请跟上，阿尔图罗小姐。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g2_laterano_cathedralhall"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......就是这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"经文柱？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那两根经文柱中间，雕刻着《圣徒行记》的石板......按照篇目的顺序依次按动圣徒像的光环，然后，推开这面墙壁。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我曾多次在这里向教宗阁下汇报公务，却从未发现大教堂内存在这样的机关。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"或许是因为你不曾对拉特兰感到怀疑吧。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"希望即将见到的事物，不会动摇两位的信念。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那还真是令人期待。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_black"},{"type":"narration","text":"安多恩曾经跟着教宗由此下行。\n他们将经过诸位圣贤的埋骨地，经过陈列着他们伟业的石碑与圣像，一路穿越拉特兰数千年的岁月，直抵历史尽头。\n但......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g5_undergroundcorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"安多恩怀疑自己的记忆出现了错乱——\n原本的洁白已经不见，整条通道被深重的铁色铺满，显得格外冰冷。\n圣像倒是依旧陈列在两侧，但极不规则的机械块状物从墙壁中生出，吞噬了它们的手臂、眼睛，或者双腿......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看来，我们的历史正被魔鬼抚摸着......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩先生，感谢你的警告，不然我可能会更惊讶一些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，这里发生了变化。"},{"type":"narration","text":"安多恩紧蹙着眉头，视线尽处，隐隐跳跃着红光——安多恩清楚那是什么。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"看见那红光了吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它来自我们的终点，但本应继续下行很长一段距离才能看见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"小心。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣堂巡卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"头戴斗篷的巡卫突然出现，他在看见费德里科的瞬间开火，没有任何交涉的意愿。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣堂巡卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"警告。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"圣堂巡卫","speakerId":"avg_npc_1789_1","isRemote":false,"text":"重复警告，发现入侵者，立即清除。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"刺耳的警报声呼啸着，三人的视野里出现了越来越多的巡卫，他们本就模糊的面目隐没在斗篷下，像是鬼魅......\n唯有光环愈发夺目。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"原本在梦境中守卫育婴圣堂的卫兵却出现在了这里......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这恰恰说明......我们来对了地方。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位，跟在我身后。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g10_fadedbalcony"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里绝非“梦境”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"明明一切都是真实的，可为什么色彩却......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"被抹去了。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"普瑞赛斯......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这里很安静，我们不会再听见那些吵闹的动静了。"},{"type":"narration","text":"她站在角落，望着眼前死寂的景象，似乎完全没有防备你们。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不喜欢这样的景色，{@nickname}，太安静了些。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但我们别无他法，不是吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她没有限制我，博士。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（阿米娅不在，我没法保证能拖住她......我会尽力——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"放松，你们在这里很安全。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我不会让那些萨科塔引发的混乱波及你们。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你为什么能出现在这里？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"我以为你还被封存在罗德岛上。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这和我当下所在意的事情相比，并不重要。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（已进入进攻姿态。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（抱歉，博士，我估计她能突然冒出来恐怕还是因为我......）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（我也没有想到，在我刚刚试图访问PCS的时候，她会抓到我的踪迹——）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"这场灾异因你而起？","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"灾异？我只看到物种在演变，生灵在无谓地奔忙。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"此刻拉特兰城中所发生的一切，都是PCS自行推演后输出的结果。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我只是在此之前对它重新做了校准，让它能回归原本的用途，以此来适配源石项目的进程。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}，我们的进度已经比预期落后了太多太多。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......校准？","value":"1","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少你并未遗忘自己求知的本性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"PCS作为基于仿生学诞生的实验性质产物，曾为我们的科学团队和军队提供了不少便利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但遗落在泰拉之后，由于长期缺少维护，它的认知辐射增强器进入了半待机模式，运行效率已经极大衰减。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过有趣的是，与泰拉本地物种接触之后，它反倒产生了出乎我意料的影响——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不仅受益者的认知与情绪得以共享，连物种特征都趋于同化。这一结果在我们过往的测试中从未出现。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"令人惊喜，不是吗，{@nickname}？"}]},{"label":"......原本的用途？","value":"2","blocks":[{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至少你并未遗忘自己求知的本性。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"PCS作为基于仿生学诞生的实验性质产物，虽然我们始终未能掌握其原型的本质，且其在使用上存在干扰受试者认知功能的风险——"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"但在更严峻的灾难面前，它依旧被提前投入使用。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"它能在保留个体思维能力和特征的前提下，减少沟通的阻碍，强化个体之间的联系......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这为我们的科学团队和军队提供了不少便利。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"遗落在泰拉之后，它已蒙尘太久，但{@nickname}，你明白的，它的潜力远不止于此。"}]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"你刚刚还提到，适配源石项目的进程？","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"可它和源石项目有什么关系呢？","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别着急，{@nickname}，我会向你解释的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不过，你的新同伴似乎有话想对你说。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（坏消息，博士，我没有发现这里有任何退路。）"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"如果她的目的仍是源石......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"或许，我们已经不在拉特兰......","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"这里恐怕是未来的拉特兰......","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——？！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"敏锐的直觉，但缺乏了基础的认知。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这只是借助PCS系统向你们展示的某种可能性的幻影。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不再有时间，不再有色彩，一个永恒静滞之所。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}，暂且在这难得的时间里与我同行吧，远离那些本就与你无关的纷争。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"不对，你害怕我接触到PCS系统。","value":"1","blocks":[]},{"label":"你也没有料到我会出现在这里。","value":"2","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"从你的语气中，我感受到了......恨。我理解。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——因为AMa-10，你的“凯尔希”。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"......","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"当时你离开得太匆忙，你有许多疑惑尚未得到解答，而我也有很多猜测需要向你求证。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（她的状态......好像不对劲，这和她当初在甲板上的表现不太一样。）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"（博士，我可以尝试进攻——）"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"收好你的爪子。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"“Mon3tr”，我尊重你给自己挑选的名字，但我比你自己更加了解你的本质。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"{@nickname}，如果你想AMa-10回来，我可以帮你。你知道在哪里能找到我。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我知道这也是你所愿，“Mon3tr”。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"Mon3tr","speakerId":"avg_4179_monstr_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"别被她影响，Mon3tr！","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"choice","options":[{"label":"站在我们面前的不是她的本体。","value":"1","blocks":[]}]},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你一直很执着于物质与现实的联系。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石本就是我们创造的语言，我自然可以借助源石让我选定的目标听到我的声音。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"普瑞赛斯","speakerId":"avg_npc_1718_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对你们如此，对那台机器同样如此——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g6_pcsderivativemaze"},{"type":"narration","text":"“为了回应我，它增殖后生成了更加庞大的缓存区来支持新一轮的演算。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g6_pcsderivativemaze"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"“机械基于其被设定的逻辑运作，寻求其自身和达成情绪共振的群体的延续。”\n“而你们却贸然地断定这是需要被中止的异常，那些萨科塔甚至将其视作律法的拒斥......”\n“{@nickname}，跟我来。”\n“用自己的眼睛去看看真正的危机。”"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"教皇厅各部门有独立的办公场所，大教堂只是一座仪式性的建筑，它的地下不应该有如此复杂的空间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"两位，我们需要进行最后一次验证。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g5_undergroundcorridor"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩先生，你之前走的应该是条单行道吧？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"而我们第六次改变方向，却再一次经过了这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，是第七次。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......退回去。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g6_pcsderivativemaze"},{"type":"narration","text":"三人重新退回了之前的位置，这是一个平台，教堂的白与机械的黑交融在一起，又被不知从何处透来的红光肆意涂抹......\n无序、紊乱、失衡、危险......无论从建筑学还是宗教学的角度，一切形状和结构都在此失去了意义，他们不禁怀疑自己是否身处拉特兰。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科&阿尔图罗","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"——"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"费德里科与阿尔图罗同时停下了脚步，眼下的经历太过熟悉，在见到巫王之前，他们曾在无尽的阶梯中辗转。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不必再往前了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这是一段原本并不存在的衍生结构，暂时并不清楚其原理与作用，但毫无疑问，它扭曲了原本的空间。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......我们正身处一个难以理解的迷宫。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"祂在阻止我们靠近。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......谁？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"萨科塔的主，一切的答案。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别暴露我们的位置，费迪。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我在这些家伙身上感受不到任何属于人的情感，他们真的是萨科塔吗，还是清扫这个迷宫的机器？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"应该和地面上的那些生物性质相同，正常萨科塔如果攻击他们，依然会导致堕天。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"越往下，这些家伙的数量越多，他们之间的......“共感”也越强。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"短暂地击退一波，只会引来更多......我们将彻底迷失在这里。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那支队伍移动的速度很快，到达大教堂用不了太长时间，蕾缪安枢机等人能完全阻止他们行进的概率极低。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"必须调查清楚灾异的原委，我们已经耗费了太多时间。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......或许，我能出一些力。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"费德里科","speakerId":"avg_1032_excu2_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你身上的伤很重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"对付这些巡卫，当然要交给两位。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"至于寻路，刚好是我擅长的事情。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"一簇光在安多恩手心亮起。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"阿尔图罗","speakerId":"avg_245_cello_1","isRemote":false,"text":"源石技艺？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"27_g17_lighthouse_alley"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"咳咳，谢谢你，小安多恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1809_1","isRemote":false,"text":"吉姆大叔，你不该跑这么远！我一整天都没见到你，问了一圈才知道你来了海边。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我想着来找点吃的......没想到海边的雾会这么重。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1809_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪怕没撞见海雾，这一带也有海盗出没啊！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1809_1","isRemote":false,"text":"别轻易离开潮石镇......起码，起码下次叫上我一起。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"好的好的......说起来，刚刚那是你的源石技艺？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"雾气那么浓，我连自己的鞋都看不清，我以为再也找不到方向了，结果一束光照了过来......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我，我还以为是附近的灯塔被修好了！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1809_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哪有那么夸张！不过幸好帮到你了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"不过小安多恩，我听说你的同胞们都是用铳的，量身定做的铳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"受伤的镇民","speakerId":"avg_npc_187","isRemote":false,"text":"我还听说，你的家乡，那个叫拉特兰的地方，是一个无所不能的乐园......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1809_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我的家乡是潮石镇。我生在这里，长在这里，吉姆大叔。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1809_1","isRemote":false,"text":"走，回家吧，这些粮食我来背着就好。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_wilderness_m"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"光晕开了晨雾，对方的视线受阻，而我会给你指引——菲亚梅塔，抓住机会。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"搞定！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"蕾缪安，莫斯提马，打扫战场。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安&莫斯提马","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"收到，队长。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩，可以啊，还藏了这么一手！这帮流寇人太多，要没你的源石技艺，一时半会儿还真解决不了。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......只是下意识的反应。拿到守护铳之前，我一直靠它解决一些麻烦，自己的，别人的。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"没它，我甚至都没法找到拉特兰。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"差点忘了，你是加入戍卫队前夕才拿到守护铳......不过，你的铳术很好，一点都看不出你之前没用过铳！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"毕竟它是拉特兰人生活的一部分，不是吗？我应该要习惯。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"更何况，这段时间我已经发现，铳械和光环让拉特兰自身坚不可摧，它并不需要我这点微芒。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你又开始说这些话了，安多恩。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"哈哈，抱歉。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"菲亚梅塔","speakerId":"avg_300_phenxi_1","isRemote":false,"text":"这次作战和戍卫队本来的计划出入还挺大的，细节要如实写吗？算了，反正最后报告书你都会帮着润色的。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"可拉特兰之外呢？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"还有多少座潮石镇，还有多少信仰照拂不到的孤岛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我忘不了，我看得见......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"——！"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"————！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_i17_2"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"bg_cave_5"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是拉特兰，还是......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不，没有区别。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"如果连最漆黑的污秽也能被属灵的洁白洗去，最狰狞的怪物也能满心虔诚地跋涉出泥淖......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那是不是根本就没有什么信仰照拂不到的孤岛？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"那又是为什么，我所见、所识之人，无一得救？一定少了什么，我还没有看见......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"......一条道路。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不是一种力量，不是一处地点，只是......一条道途，从现时的苦难，到未来的救赎。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"你、你能展现未来，就一定知晓通向它的道路。告诉我，给我看......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"？？？","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"......"},{"type":"narration","text":"虚无的巨物在时空的罅隙里游弋，没有回应安多恩哪怕一句。\n那诡异却又真实的景象，所有的细节都随祂的沉默而开始波动，一切都被蒙上了一层厚重的云翳。"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"不，不......"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":"avg_npc_1800_1","isRemote":false,"text":"我需要知晓更多！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"安多恩，你能听得清我说话吗？"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"蕾缪安","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"把那东西放下......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"dialogue","speakerName":"安多恩","speakerId":null,"isRemote":false,"text":"不，蕾缪安，你不知道我看到了什么，我不能停下！"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"光芒在安多恩的手中尽情绽开，像是急速步入花期的植株，近乎衰败般盛放。\n他想要破开那云翳，他想要看清那启示，他想要抓住那可能。\n......"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"26_g5_laterano_chapelout"},{"type":"narration","text":"那之后，他背着罪与孽重新踏上旅途，他引着异族的教众回到拉特兰，去求一个答案。\n可他甚至没能来得及分享自己的所见，那真相差点令他动摇。\n他行过了许多路，唯一不变的是什么呢？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g6_pcsderivativemaze"},{"type":"narration","text":"他只是永远记得，那一年，海风埋葬了家园，自己怀着怎样的心情离开潮石镇——\n那是长路的起点。\n执行者与巡卫激战的声音不绝于耳，安多恩毫无保留地释放源石技艺，无尽的光从他的身体里透出，逶迤向迷宫的深处。\n那光并不炫目，它柔和，甚至有些黯淡，像是阳光抚上一地秋叶，去找它们坠落的位置。\n他问自己，寻路者，这长路何时终结？"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"narration","text":"终于......\n刺眼的红光切断了他的源石技艺。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"61_g7_pcsserverroom"},{"type":"narration","text":"他曾随伊万杰利斯塔十一世见过那景象，他也曾因此动摇......\n而此刻，那光比当时更冰冷，更刺眼，也更危险。\n可安多恩不愿闭上眼睛。\n他知道那冰冷的机器是主，是神祇，是信仰的根基。\n安多恩看向神，他绝不回避。\n他找他失去，他思他质疑。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":"39_i14"},{"type":"narration","text":"尖锐的疼痛席卷了安多恩，他的双目几乎是在一瞬间不再能视物，但在同时......\n他听见了神的回应。"},{"type":"sceneBreak"},{"type":"background","backgroundId":null}],"observedOperators":[]}
